{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/14889","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:55:56.797809+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"That's not good! I'll take a look - thanks for the simple reproducer!","created_at":"2023-08-31T15:31:24Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/14889#issuecomment-1701268596","id":1701268596,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/14889","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M5lZ0x0","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/1701268596/reactions"},"updated_at":"2023-08-31T15:31:24Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/1701268596","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"### What happened?\r\n\r\nIn a first dispatch `%arg0` (`%arg2`) is a read-only resource and produces new value, in second dispatch it's tied to output. ScheduleConcurrency incorrectly places them into the same concurrent region.\r\n\r\n```mlir\r\nmodule {\r\n  func.func @partitioningForConcurrency(%arg0: !stream.resource<external>) -> (!stream.resource<external>, !stream.resource<external>) {\r\n    %c0 = arith.constant 0 : index\r\n    %c1 = arith.constant 1 : index\r\n    %c4 = arith.constant 4 : index\r\n    %results:2, %result_timepoint = stream.async.execute with(%arg0 as %arg1: !stream.resource<external>{%c4}) -> (!stream.resource<external>{%c4}, %arg0{%c4}) {\r\n      %1 = stream.async.dispatch @ex::@dispatch_0[%c1, %c1, %c1](%arg1[%c0 to %c4 for %c4]) : (!stream.resource<external>{%c4}) -> !stream.resource<external>{%c4}\r\n      %2 = stream.async.dispatch @ex::@dispatch_1[%c1, %c1, %c1](%arg1[%c0 to %c4 for %c4]) : (!stream.resource<external>{%c4}) -> %arg1{%c4}\r\n      stream.yield %1, %2 : !stream.resource<external>{%c4}, !stream.resource<external>{%c4}\r\n    } => !stream.timepoint\r\n    %0:2 = stream.timepoint.await %result_timepoint => %results#0, %results#1 : !stream.resource<external>{%c4}, !stream.resource<external>{%c4}\r\n    return %0#0, %0#1 : !stream.resource<external>, !stream.resource<external>\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nbuild/tools/iree-opt <file> -pass-pipeline=\"builtin.module(func.func(iree-stream-schedule-concurrency))\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n%1:2 = stream.async.concurrent with(%arg1 as %arg2: !stream.resource<external>{%c4}) -> (!stream.resource<external>{%c4}, !stream.resource<external>{%c4}) {\r\n        %2 = stream.async.dispatch @ex::@dispatch_0[%c1, %c1, %c1](%arg2[%c0 to %c4 for %c4]) : (!stream.resource<external>{%c4}) -> !stream.resource<external>{%c4}\r\n        %3 = stream.async.dispatch @ex::@dispatch_1[%c1, %c1, %c1](%arg2[%c0 to %c4 for %c4]) : (!stream.resource<external>{%c4}) -> %arg2{%c4}\r\n        stream.yield %2, %3 : !stream.resource<external>{%c4}, !stream.resource<external>{%c4}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`dispatch_0` reads from `%arg2` and `dispatch_1` write into the same resource in the same concurrent region.\r\n\r\nShould concurrency partitioning also check all users of all resource arguments here: https://github.com/openxla/iree/blob/main/compiler/src/iree/compiler/Dialect/Stream/Analysis/Partitioning/ReferencePartitioning.cpp#L359-L362 ?","closed_at":"2023-08-31T17:33:28Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/14889/comments","created_at":"2023-08-31T02:57:27Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/14889/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/14889","id":1874704851,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"1d76db","default":false,"description":"Relating to the IREE compiler dialects (flow, hal, vm)","id":1921021544,"name":"compiler/dialect